{"items":[{"id":"1305424234404106240","title":"以前： 仰天大笑出门去，我辈岂是蓬蒿人","content":"<p>以前：&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;仰天大笑出门去，我辈岂是蓬蒿人。&lt;br&gt;现在：&lt;br&gt;低头低腰甘做小，打工才是人上人。</p>","excerpt":"以前： 仰天大笑出门去，我辈岂是蓬蒿人","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":14,"created":1604017391,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1305424234404106240"},{"id":"1302628145497939968","title":"大作手","content":"<p>大作手</p><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/50/v2-e02a127d78e96445665d408817c68080_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1109\">","excerpt":"大作手","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":9,"created":1603350751,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1302628145497939968"},{"id":"1301936146084229120","title":"[想法的图片]","content":"<img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/50/v2-ae4a798fc77c4a0617ece8218c419cb3_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"426\" height=\"256\">","excerpt":"[想法的图片]","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":7,"created":1603185766,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1301936146084229120"},{"id":"1301481243767586816","title":"某部门：不要卷，我们不要搞超前教育，要…","content":"<p>某部门：不要卷，我们不要搞超前教育，要减轻孩子负担。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;家长：....增加这么多科目，这些科目不报班能行嘛？&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;某部门：没事，大家不必在意，这就是个小检验。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;高校：严格按照考试成绩录取。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;孩子：卒</p><img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/50/v2-1189bb4334ed47c78b1338f9af28d49f_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"369\" height=\"657\">","excerpt":"某部门：不要卷，我们不要搞超前教育，要…","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":20,"created":1603077308,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1301481243767586816"},{"id":"1300492782230847488","title":"额，这两天大家看着美国这些荒谬的消息不…","content":"<p>额，这两天大家看着美国这些荒谬的消息不要觉得奇怪，这很正常嘛。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;大选一过就是一切拨乱反正的时候。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;不是拜登高呼特朗普鞠躬尽瘁，死而后已，就是特朗普赞叹拜登北美之光，人民领袖。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;珍惜现在的快乐时光吧。</p>","excerpt":"额，这两天大家看着美国这些荒谬的消息不…","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":2,"created":1602841641,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1300492782230847488"},{"id":"1300120327339540480","title":"[想法的图片]","content":"<img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-3415f1cbf1e4f2dd528e54d9f4555c6d_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"616\" height=\"800\">","excerpt":"[想法的图片]","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":28,"created":1602752841,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1300120327339540480"},{"id":"1299723365901668352","title":"[想法的图片]","content":"<img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/50/v2-205e4d973d34e3a31ae247ab8701dbf8_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"1235\">","excerpt":"[想法的图片]","voteupCount":1,"commentCount":30,"created":1602658198,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1299723365901668352"},{"id":"1298607236927459328","title":"古人诚不我欺","content":"<p>古人诚不我欺</p>","excerpt":"古人诚不我欺","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":6,"created":1602392092,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1298607236927459328"},{"id":"1297968693150679040","title":"[想法的图片]","content":"<img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/50/v2-5ea3479c2028122c3e90b95e057ab9ca_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"424\">","excerpt":"[想法的图片]","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":10,"created":1602239851,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1297968693150679040"},{"id":"1297523801039556608","title":"我从没有一刻感到自己离老年这么近","content":"<p>我从没有一刻感到自己离老年这么近</p><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-60ea0c9d659b567ff5df26f7dd3dba20_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1920\">","excerpt":"我从没有一刻感到自己离老年这么近","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":12,"created":1602133780,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1297523801039556608"}]}